        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "He has brought the high fortress of your walls down, laid low, and brought to the ground, even to the dust.",
      "ko": "너의 성벽의 높은 보장을 헐어 땅에 내리시되 진토에 미치게 하시리라",
      "source_text_hash": "a80f685554bcc034d0d32448e52dd3672631a1a840927a1b592f25ccb9d4c2b9",
      "translation_text_hash": "616502f01bbb1aee17a682cd3571ce2dae92e63ce167b630791851f83a7faeab",
